#This example script has a couple of problems
#The biggest issue is that the parser reads the pos file and overwrites it thus all spawns happen at Lille
#To address this suggest using several individual files, one for each location, preferrign 0-200 players per location
#I usually address this by commenting out certain sections each time I call the script in game

#Spawn british at Brussels AF
login 0-199 1 1
pos 213153.54 3053243.76 45
spawn 0-199 ukrifle

#Spawn germans at Bertrix AF
 login 300-499 4 1
 pos 252377.81 991643.36 430
 spawn 300-499 derifle

#Spawn french at Lille AF
 login 600-799 3 1
 pos 147536.98 3038863.24 35
 spawn 600-799 frrifle

